      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 739467210,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "> Fix a couple of filters.\n\nPresumably meaning \"Fix misspelling in a couple of field names\"; field names can be used in filter expressions, but 1) they are used elsewhere in *Shark as well and 2) a filter is an expression involving field names, operators, and values, so you can have filter that consist of more than just a field name.",
          "author": {
            "id": 5636682,
            "username": "guyharris",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Guy Harris",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1b7c243a9b1d6587a9a9067e5d83aba1e87212df7c4eeae3690f791ecbe4675a?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/guyharris"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-11-21T20:53:55.539Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-11-21T21:22:37.325Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 127134995,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 5165,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 739471318,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, the commit string should have said something like:\n\n\"Fixed a couple of likely copy/pasted filter strings in field items\"\n\nThis ought to have only been for the changes in packet-iso14443.c and packet-usb-com.c - where consecutive items have very different labels but the same (presumably copy/pasted) filter string.\n\nI closed it because it also has (the beginning of) another change in it (I must have created the branch off 'spell' rather than master..)",
          "author": {
            "id": 6810036,
            "username": "martin.r.mathieson",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Martin Mathieson",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/030414c33f619ee28811cd9c073802ef2267d160ab2744eb8427bd49af4c7998?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/martin.r.mathieson"
          },
